# Architecture decision records

One decision per file: `docs/decisions/NNNN-short-title.md`. Take the next free number. Update the index table in `docs/decisions/README.md` in the same change.

Keep an accepted ADR's decision text. A reversal is a new ADR whose status line names the record it supersedes, and the old file's status becomes `superseded by NNNN`.

```markdown
# ADR NNNN: Title

- Status: proposed | accepted | superseded
- Date: YYYY-MM-DD

## Context

## Decision

## Consequences
```
